00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:28,500
Studio 54 was the epicenter of 70s hedonism - a place that not only
redefined the nightclub, but also came to symbolize an entire era.

4
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:36,000
Its co-owners, Ian Schrager and Steve Rubell, two friends from Brooklyn, seemed to come
out of nowhere to suddenly preside over a new kind of New York society.

5
00:30:37,500 --> 00:30:43,500
Now, 39 years after the velvet rope was first slung across the club's hallowed threshold, a
feature documentary tells the real story behind the greatest club of all time.

